                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h2]Bad game, have fun.[/h2]\r\n\r\nLet's get one thing clear and out of the way. I don't do drugs, although I believe I may have been high after playing this game. Not the good kind of high either. The achievement seeking dopamine effect. Gotta keep the dopamine train going.\r\n\r\nI honestly don't remember playing this game because I do remember it giving me a headache and for some reason I decided to push for the achievements. I think the stress from trying actually killed the dopamine effect.\r\n\r\nThis game was so bad that I don't really remember a single aspect from it other than the fact that I clearly played it for achievements. Wait didn't I just say that? Jeesh, I'll stop.\r\n\r\nBad game, have fun.\r\n\r\n[h2]4/10[/h2]\r\n\r\n[h3][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45905648-Gork%2527s-Game-Grind/]Check out my curated list of games[/url][/h3]",
